  "prefLabel": "Plc 102.13 Inspection",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 102.13 “Inspection” means an examination of the conditions and records at a regulated place of business to determine compliance with applicable law, that is not undertaken to investigate a complaint or other information received by the OPLC suggesting that conditions do not meet requirements. The term includes “routine inspection”.\n\nSource. #14135, eff 12-1-24",
